{"words": [{"text": "أَوَعَجِبْتُمْ", "translation": "Do you wonder"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "جَآءَكُمْ", "translation": "has come to you"}, {"text": "ذِكْرٌۭ", "translation": "a reminder"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "رَّبِّكُمْ", "translation": "your Lord"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "رَجُلٍۢ", "translation": "a man"}, {"text": "مِّنكُمْ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "لِيُنذِرَكُمْ ۚ", "translation": "that he may warn you"}, {"text": "وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟", "translation": "And remember"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "جَعَلَكُمْ", "translation": "He made you"}, {"text": "خُلَفَآءَ", "translation": "successors"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "قَوْمِ", "translation": "(the) people"}, {"text": "نُوحٍۢ", "translation": "(of) Nuh"}, {"text": "وَزَادَكُمْ", "translation": "and increased you"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْخَلْقِ", "translation": "the stature"}, {"text": "بَصْۜطَةًۭ ۖ", "translation": "extensively"}, {"text": "فَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟", "translation": "So remember"}, {"text": "ءَالَآءَ", "translation": "(the) Bounties"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translation": "so that you may"}, {"text": "تُفْلِحُونَ", "translation": "succeed"}], "sahih": "Then do you wonder that there has come to you a reminder from your Lord through a man from among you, that he may warn you? And remember when He made you successors after the people of Noah and increased you in stature extensively. So remember the favors of Allāh that you might succeed.\""}